#     the triple of a catalog that cannot be loaded (`without_a_catalog`).
#   the line a refusal logs (`renderSpecRefused code= path=`): the test's Host writes its standard error where no
#     test reads it.
#   that a refusal of a render spec that comes through the routes of other artifacts is said as a render spec's
#     (`Why::Spec(_) => return render_spec::said(why)` in `library::conflict`): every render spec door says its
